      "unit_reconciliation": "The audited income statement reports EPS of 312. The audited statement of changes in equity shows the same paid-up capital throughout FY2025 and no treasury-share movement. The charter amendment records 500 million shares. The FY2024, interim FY2025 and FY2025 statutory capital disclosures allocate all paid-up capital to ordinary shares. Dividing audited earnings of 156,156,635 thousand UZS by 500 million shares reproduces the reported amount in UZS per ordinary share.",
